      "revId": "a3ec7a9464ef50bc75807df8b49b75fe847809fb",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "793dfee6_eb8d8e06",
        "filename": "common/usbc/usb_tc_drp_acc_trysrc_sm.c",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 2724,
      "author": {
        "id": 1287197
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-09-09T20:27:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, I believe so.  Plus when we\u0027re presenting Rp, I think we\u0027re relatively safe from erroneous open detection since V Open \u003e V Rd and messaging will, in general, be causing the CC voltage to go periodically lower than V Rd (as opposed to higher).",
      "parentUuid": "a93d2ea4_8702cdcc",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2724,
        "startChar": 5,
        "endLine": 2724,
        "endChar": 32
      },
      "revId": "a3ec7a9464ef50bc75807df8b49b75fe847809fb",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "6bd6759a_81c373b0",
        "filename": "common/usbc/usb_tc_drp_acc_trysrc_sm.c",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 2724,
      "author": {
        "id": 1269501
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-09-09T21:06:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Per TCPCI spec tSetReg (4.4.6.1 CC_STATUS (Normative))  tCcStatusDelay + tTCPCFilter + tCcTCPCSampleRate (max) (Table 4-21. Debounce requirements) is /supposed/ to be how they debounce.\n\nHowever as Diana cites there are many that (a) send false/spurious/phantom #ALERT reads (b) debounce far longer/shorter than this.\n\nAlso there are some partners that (inappropriately) send PS_RDY#1 before setting Rd. Like many older TCPMv1 Chromebooks with no more flash space. Or patches pending such as Eve.\n\nSuggest running (older CB/Eve SRC-to-SNK) PR_SWAP and scoping the CC line, and see how stack reacts. Unless we don\u0027t monitor CC line state for vOpen mid-PR_SWAP (which might also be bad).",
      "parentUuid": "793dfee6_eb8d8e06",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2724,
        "startChar": 5,
        "endLine": 2724,
        "endChar": 32
